{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47231","headline":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 六 · 吴越僧","name":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登云步岭涉烟程，好景随心次第生。\n圣者已符祥瑞事，地灵全副祷祈情。\n洞深重叠拖云湿，滩浅潺湲漱水清。\n愿满事圆归去路，便风相送片帆轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47231.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47231","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}